config PROFILE_AMD64
    prompt "Target profile"
    type choice
    var ROSCONFIG_PROFILE
    value generic "Generic AMD64"
    value lattepandamu "LattePanda Mu"
    default generic
    depends ARCH=amd64
    help
      Generic builds the architecture-independent AMD64 target.

      LattePanda Mu exposes the board-specific FreeLdr HTTP boot option and
      external UEFI network stack. Optional modules are selected independently
      in the Modules submenu.
